vocal-plasma (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Russian TTS via Piper (ru_RU-irina-medium, offline, bundled)
  * Auto language detection: Cyrillic text -> Russian voice, else Kokoro
  * speak flags: -l/--lang auto|en|ru, -v/--voice, -s/--speed, -h
  * kokoro-venv-setup: sync step installs new deps into the existing venv
    before falling back to a full rebuild

 -- vlad <v@piratweb.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 19:55:00 +0200

vocal-plasma (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Venv survives python3 version bumps: new kokoro-venv-setup relinks the
    venv to its python (offline) or rebuilds it; speak self-checks on start;
    dpkg trigger on /usr/bin/python3
  * Depends: add python3-venv; drop python3-pip, curl, wget, needrestart
  * Support python >= 3.11 (was 3.13 only)
  * build.sh -> build, binary-only build, artifacts in dist/
  * postrm purge: clean shortcuts of all /home users, not only root

 -- vlad <v@piratweb.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 19:32:52 +0200

vocal-plasma (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Vocal Plasma
  * High-quality text-to-speech for KDE Plasma desktop
  * Text-to-Speech using Kokoro ONNX neural network model
  * Supports multiple voices (American/British, Male/Female)
  * Includes command-line interface and KDE Plasma shortcuts (Alt+Esc)
  * Bundled with Kokoro v1.0 model and voice embeddings

 -- Package Maintainer <maintainer@example.com>  Sun, 01 Dec 2025 12:00:00 +0000
